@startuml
actor Candidate
participant FE
participant ApplicantSvc
database DB


Candidate -> FE : Vào "Việc làm đã ứng tuyển"
FE -> ApplicantSvc : listApplications(userId) ' sync
ApplicantSvc -> DB : SELECT applications ' sync
DB --> ApplicantSvc : rows
loop mỗi bản ghi
ApplicantSvc -> DB : getCurrentStatus(appId) ' sync
DB --> ApplicantSvc : status
end
ApplicantSvc --> FE : apps + status ' reply
@enduml